  {
   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2021-05-26",
   "text": "Clean Ocean And Safe Tourism Anti-Drilling Act or the COAST Anti-Drilling Act\n This bill prohibits the Department of the Interior from authorizing the exploration, development, or production (i.e., offshore drilling) of oil or natural gas in specified planning areas of the Outer Continental Shelf along the Atlantic Coast, including the Straits of Florida."
  }
